WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.860 --> 00:00:08.300
The truth is when producers wanted me to be
 sexy but always with some absurd spin on it,

00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:11.880
that made me feel like I was still in control.

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:29.640
What happened in the last five years, real fans probably knew deep down that there was something going on.

00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:32.860
Paranoia, fear, body pain, anxiety.

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:39.940
I go from everyone touching me all day 
and talking at me all day to total silence

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:43.520
and all these people will leave and then I'll be alone.

00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:48.720
I didn't feel good enough and I do now.

00:00:48.740 --> 00:00:50.100
That's the good part.

00:00:54.900 --> 00:01:04.040
I have chased this pain for five years, but when I feel the adrenaline of my music and my fans, I can fucking go.

00:01:08.260 --> 00:01:11.200
My family is the most important thing in my life.

00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:13.200
Hi, Grandma!

00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:15.200
Hello there.

00:01:15.679 --> 00:01:17.279
She died when she was 19.

00:01:19.369 --> 00:01:22.512
I can always bring my past with 
me, but I can never go back.

00:01:22.512 --> 00:01:24.188
You got to leave yourself behind.

00:01:28.960 --> 00:01:33.240
I want to do the opposite of what 
everyone thinks I'm gonna do.

00:01:34.100 --> 00:01:36.220
There really isn't anything bigger than this.

00:01:49.220 --> 00:01:51.520
Do you have the new Lady Gaga album?

00:01:52.680 --> 00:01:53.900
The new lady named what?

00:01:53.900 --> 00:01:55.820
Lady Gaga album?

00:01:56.080 --> 00:01:57.680
Oh! Do we have them?

00:01:57.780 --> 00:01:58.780
Yeah.

